@why [creativity-commons/distributed-monitoring]

! conclusion: Every operator turn appears in the evidence landscape (Joe 2026-08-28: the fundamental invariant; everything else builds from it).

  + IF:
    Without the operator's turns in the record, nothing an agent did can be traced to what was asked.

  + HOWEVER:
    Turns pass through several transports, and a seam can drop one without any agent noticing.

  + THEN:
    Every operator turn appears in the evidence landscape (Joe 2026-08-28: the fundamental invariant; everything else builds from it).

  + BECAUSE:
    Everything else builds on this: without the operator's turn, nothing an agent did can be traced to what was asked.

  + VALIDATION:
    Does every operator turn appear in the evidence landscape?
